  - `LibSyncAuthorized`/`libKC`, `SyncSound`;
  - `NewMutexOk`, `AcquireOk`, `UnlockOk`, `ResetLockOk`;
  - `Label`, `LStep`, `Encap`, `EncapsulatedTrace`.
